[00:01.24]1. Bless us as we meet together,
[00:07.38]O Jehovah, we now pray.
[00:13.64]We are thankful for our meetings;
[00:19.14]May your spirit with us stay.
[00:26.68]2. Help us, Lord, refine our worship;
[00:29.64]With your Word, oh, do us fill.
[00:29.70]Train our minds and tongues to witness;
[00:29.70]Love within our hearts instill.
[00:29.72]3. Loving Father, bless our meetings;
[00:29.72]Grant us peace and unity.
[01:24.48]May our words and may our actions
[01:29.98]Magnify your Sov’reignty.
